/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/e6e901f64a49d9c31f64331dc196f11d.avif?t=1755197513\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/25a0789799430831f18f2b0ef19ab6d0.avif?t=1755197513\" width=1600 height=303 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving isn't easy. Strategizing your moves is crucial to staying alive. Complete essential tasks during daylight and be aware of the darkness, as nighttime brings <strong>lower</strong> <strong>temperatures</strong>. <strong>Weather conditions</strong> are unpredictable and change dynamically, so always be prepared!\u00a0 Explore a<strong> huge map</strong>, but remember that not every place is safe; some may be inaccessible based on your current gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/5fe7f1507c6588b732105e45c3e51a6b.poster.avif?t=1755197513\" width=994 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/5fe7f1507c6588b732105e45c3e51a6b.webm?t=1755197513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/e6e901f64a49d9c31f64331dc196f11d.avif?t=1755197513\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/bf998fab7fc3ecaaf3efa258d8d1c976.avif?t=1755197513\" width=1600 height=303 /></s