nd dangerous animals. <strong>Shape your survival sandbox experience your way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/b5b47cc6e0652fdabb36ea5e67aadcae.poster.avif?t=1755197513\" width=994 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/b5b47cc6e0652fdabb36ea5e67aadcae.webm?t=1755197513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/e6e901f64a49d9c31f64331dc196f11d.avif?t=1755197513\" width=1017 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/extras/5cf520f50b0968a580a59a5f0cb2b2bd.avif?t=1755197513\" width=1583 height=378 /></span>The project is co-funded by the MEDIA strand of the European Union\u2019s Creative Europe Programme.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wenkly Studio Sp. z o.o."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3054950","name":"Frost Survival VR"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883260/37444ab5aca6fc780c348883affabef3653b3c68/header.jpg?t=1755197513","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2024 Wenkly Studio Sp. z o.o.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u